        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: The Shame of a City, Unchained Memories\n- Events: Philadelphia Film Festival\n- Organizations: Federal Writers' Project\n- Systems: WPA Slave Narrative Collection\n- Topics: Documentary films, former slaves' oral histories\n\nFacts:\n- Unchained Memories is a 2003 documentary film about stories of former slaves who were interviewed during the 1930s.\n- The former slaves' interviews featured in Unchained Memories were conducted as part of the Federal Writers' Project.\n- The former slaves' interviews featured in Unchained Memories were preserved in the WPA Slave Narrative Collection.\n- The Shame of a City is a 2006 feature-length documentary.\n- The Shame of a City premiered at the Philadelphia Film Festival.",
